comments.body:
@adanvdo That question was for Kaivish who started this issue.  
He has an 81XXXX transmitter.  He said that he could successfully use pre-emptive restarts.  But, later, he couldn't.  
So, to clarify:

@Kaivish If you have an 81XXXX, as you said you did in the first post, and if its firmware is 1.6.5.25, you can use pre-emptive restart.
If you cannot, please let me know which version of the code fails.
